{"5110280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Autonom land Multiverse", "steam_appid": 5110280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Autonom Lands</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Explore the island at your own pace, travel between different regions, take on missions, fight hostile enemies, discover new locations, and survive in a world where danger can be around the next corner.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE A OPEN WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island is divided into different environments and locations, from large urban areas and smaller towns to countryside, industrial zones, military bases, mysterious facilities, and remote locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Travel on foot or by vehicle and decide where you want to go next. The world is designed to encourage exploration and discovery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT AND SURVIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face hostile enemies as you explore the island and complete missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use different weapons and equipment to deal with different situations, while managing the dangers of an unpredictable open world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MISSIONS AND OBJECTIVES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover missions throughout the island and complete different objectives as you progress through the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey will take you to different parts of the island, introducing new locations, challenges, enemies, and situations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A WORLD FULL OF SECRETS </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not everything on the island is immediately explained.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore abandoned buildings, strange facilities, military locations, cities, and remote areas to uncover what happened to this mysterious world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some places may be more important than they first appear.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌎 Large open-world island to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔫 Shooter and survival gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚗 Vehicles and exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 Missions and objectives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🤖 AI-controlled NPCs and enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏙️ Cities, towns and industrial areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🪖 Military bases and dangerous locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌦️ Dynamic environmental and weather systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗺️ Multiple regions with different environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔎 Exploration, discovery and hidden locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5110280/extras/5d02c8ea0187a06c0ecd2b5ccaca0147.poster.avif?t=1787847132\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5110280/extras/5d02c8ea0187a06c0ecd2b5ccaca0147.webm?t=1787847132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5110280/extras/5d02c8ea0187a06c0ecd2b5ccaca0147.mp4?t=1787847132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Autonom Lands is an independent game  artist and is currently in development.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island is growing, new gameplay systems are being added, and there is much more to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter Autonom Lands. Explore the island. Survive. And discover what is waiting for you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/